  message: "I am unsure and do not fully recall the intent. What I do remember is at some point we discussed the idea that data flow implies a direction and a direction implies discerning read ops from write ops. But how that interacts with this, I don't know, and I recommend investigating the codebase and the ADRs."  # ff71
